==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From [[:w:Tuxedo Park, New York|Tuxedo Park, New York]], USA, where the fashion is often said to have originated.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|tŭksē'dō}}, {{IPA|/tʌkˈsiːdoʊ/}}, {{SAMPA|/tVk"siːdoU/}}
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/tʌkˈsiːdəʊ/}}, {{SAMPA|/tVk"si:d@U/}}

===Noun===
[[Image:Men in black tie.jpg|thumb|right|Three men in tuxedos]]
{{en-noun|pl=tuxedos|pl2=tuxedoes}}

# A typically [[black]] [[formal]] [[jacket]] worn by men
# The entire [[suit]] complementing and including this jacket

